      },
      "solution": {
        "en": "<p>With \\( l+w=30 \\), area \\( A=l(30-l) \\), so \\( A'(l)=30-2l=0\\Rightarrow l=15 \\).</p>\\[ 15\\times 15,\\qquad A_{\\max}=225\\ \\text{m}^2. \\]",
        "ar": null
      },
      "difficulty": "Advanced"
